# Mode 2 returns an artifact AND creature at MV 3, then one at MV 0, untapped under the caster's control (CR 110.2a, 202.3).
# Breaking mills a fixed eight cards; Thought Scour puts a matching card in the opponent's graveyard (CR 109.5).
# Both modes are legal when choosing exactly one; the target refusals pin type, value, zone and player (CR 700.2a, 601.2c).

